<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers following a weekly movement of 89,500 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None   Week Ago - None   Year Ago - 1,500</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
